  "description": "ASP.NET Core Minimal API integration for the Pulse CQRS mediator. Provides IEndpointRouteBuilder extension methods that map mediator commands and queries directly to HTTP endpoints, eliminating boilerplate endpoint handlers that only forward to IMediator. Commands are mapped using the CommandHttpMethod enum (Post, Put, Patch, Delete) with full CancellationToken propagation and OpenAPI compatibility. Queries are mapped to GET endpoints with route and query-string binding via [AsParameters].",
